        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "19dca445",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "OLTP Cost calculated on Daily basis \n",
                "\n",
                "- **Total Compute Cost** =Number of DBUs used X DBU Rate  \n",
                "- **Total Storage Cost** = Number of DSUs used×Storage Rate per GB-month  \n",
                "- **Total Usage Cost (Lakebase)** =Total Compute Cost+Total Storage Cost  \n",
                "\n",
                "Where:\n",
                "- **DBU** (Databricks Unit): Represents the processing power consumed per hour.\n",
                "- **DSU** (Data Storage Unit): Represents storage consumption, usually measured per GB-month.\n",
                "- Rates are determined by your service contract or selected Databricks pricing tier."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 0,
            "width": 6,
            "height": 4
          }
        },
